// Fixture copy of the closed vocabularies of full Windows support reports,
// from the backend's internal/diagnostics/windows_support.go (copy dated
// 2026-10-09: supportApplicationEnums, supportApplicationNumbers,
// supportNativeEnums, supportNativeNumbers and supportNativeEvents). The
// backend rejects a whole report for one value outside them, so new client
// diagnostics must stay within this copy until the backend is extended.

Set<String> _words(String value) => value.split(' ').toSet();

